      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer of thanksgiving by Rabbi Arnold Kiss for deliverance from danger, “Hálaima a bajból való menekülésért,” was first published in his anthology of prayers for Jewish women, <tei:hi rend="italic">Mirjam</tei:hi> (1897) on p.286-288. It doesn’t appear to me to have been translated in the subsequent German edition (1907). I’ve set my English translation side-by-side with the Magyar. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_39192_notes"/>
